<h2 class=3D"wp-block-heading is-style-default">DGX B200 SuperPOD</h2>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">The primary AI system was provided by NVIDI=
A and built against their reference specifications for a SuperPOD. A dedica=
ted NDR400 infiniband fabric (=E2=80=9CCompute Fabric=E2=80=9D) allows for =
scaling of a single experiment to the whole SuperPOD. The system has (31) 8=
-way GPU nodes.</p>


